See `libs/AGENTS.md`, `services/scorer/AGENTS.md`, `services/core/AGENTS.md`.
- `aloai_scoring` is the only source of numbers; pure functions, no LLM, no network.
- Any formula/[CAL]/allowlist/profile change needs W3 approval, a new `scoring_module` version, a validation rerun and a PRD changelog line (use `alo-scoring-change`).
- 100% line coverage for scoring, authz, guardrails. Never loosen a test to pass.
- LLMs score propositions and items only. A word counts only when both transcripts agree.
